          %h2#References References
          %p
            A general discussion in the context of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category+theory"} (∞,1)-category theory
            is in
          %ul
            %li#HA
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacob+Lurie"}> Jacob Lurie
                , section 1.4 of:
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Higher+Algebra"} Higher Algebra
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacob+Lurie"}> Jacob Lurie
                , section 1 of:
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Spectral+Schemes"} Spectral Schemes
          %p
            An exposition of Goodwillie calculus and its role in making stabilization functorial can be found in
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#HA"} Higher Algebra
          %ul
            %li#GC
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacob+Lurie"}> Jacob Lurie
              , section 5 of:
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28infinity%2C2%29-Categories+and+the+Goodwillie+Calculus"} (infinity,2)-Categories and the Goodwillie Calculus
          %p
            Discussion of stabilization as inversion of smashing with a suspension objects, and the relation between stabilization of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-categories"} (∞,1)-categories
            (to
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-categories"} stable (∞,1)-categories
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+categories"} model categories
            (to
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+model+categories"} stable model categories
          %ul
            %li#Robalo12
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Marco+Robalo"}> Marco Robalo
              , section 4 of
              = succeed "," do
                %em Noncommutative Motives I: A Universal Characterization of the Motivic Stable Homotopy Theory of Schemes
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1206.3645"} arxiv:1206.3645
          %p published as
          %ul
            %li#Robalo15
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Marco+Robalo"}> Marco Robalo
              , section 2 of
              = succeed "," do
                %em K-theory and the bridge from motives to noncommutative motives
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aim.2014.10.011"} doi:10.1016/j.aim.2014.10.011
          %p with further remarks in
          %ul
            %li#Hoyois15
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Marc+Hoyois"}> Marc Hoyois
              , section 6.1 of
              = succeed "," do
