            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dependent+linear+homotopy+type+theory"} dependent linear homotopy type theory
            (see also on the “
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exponential+modality"}> exponential modality
            ”
            = succeed "):" do
              %a{:href => "!-modality#RealizationInLinearHomotopyTypeTheory"} here
          %ul
            %li#Riley22Thesis
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mitchell+Riley"}> Mitchell Riley
              , §2.1.2 in:
